<title>FINLAND: Rauma 1996 sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Rauma 1996 sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy on Tuesday published the following breakdown of its net sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES:			  1996	     1995</p>
<p> Timberjack			 2,156	    2,763</p>
<p> Sunds Defibrator		 3,971	    3,077</p>
<p> Nordberg			   1,931	    2,072</p>
<p> Neles-Jamesbury		  1,908	    1,674</p>
<p> Other operations		   459		532</p>
<p> Intra-group sales		 -205	     -281</p>
<p> TOTAL			     10,220	    9,837</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT:</p>
<p> Timberjack			   131		386</p>
<p> Sunds Defibrator		   367		267</p>
<p> Nordberg				89		 81</p>
<p> Neles-Jamesbury		    170		114</p>
<p> Other operations		   -47	     -106</p>
<p> TOTAL				  710		742</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
